---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import portrait from '../assets/kdu_bio.png'
---

<section class="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <div class="intro-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Hello, I’m Kapil.</p>
    <h1 id="intro-title">Making ambitious work simpler and more human.</h1>
    <p>
      I’m a tech leader based in Germany. I share thoughts, learnings, mistakes,
      and experiments from helping organisations and people find their own
      answers and unleash their potential.
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/about/"
      >A little more about me <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
    >
  </div>
  <div class="intro-portrait">
    <Image src={portrait} alt="Kapil Dube" width={160} height={160} />
  </div>
</section>
